<title>UK: ICI to sell headquarters to Prudential - paper.</title>
<headline>ICI to sell headquarters to Prudential - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Chemical Industries is poised to sell its Millbank headquarters in London to financial services and insurance giant Prudential Corporation for 100 million stg, the Sunday Telegraph reported.</p>
<p>No-one at either ICI or the Prudential was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The paper said the deal was just days away from completion and that ICI would lease the building back.</p>
<p>--Cheryl Juckes +44 272 542 5109</p>
</text>
